{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/windows' data-target='computer\/os\/windows' data-title='Windows'>\r\n\t\t\tWindows\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/windows\/network' data-target='computer\/os\/windows\/network' data-title='Network'>\r\n\t\t\tNetwork\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Remove ghosted network adapter entries by deleting matching GUIDs from Control\\Network and Tcpip together.","label":"Ghost adapters","prevArticle":null,"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/windows\/network\/network_profiles","label":"Network profiles","url":"\/computer\/os\/windows\/network\/network_profiles"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\tDelete ghosted \/ non-existent network adapter entries.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tDelete registry GUIDs with a <code class='inline'>connection<\/code> subkey whose name looks like <code class='inline'>Local area \u2026<\/code>. Record them first. Delete the matching GUIDs <strong>together<\/strong> from all of these locations.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Control\\Network<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Control\\Network\\{4D36E972-E325-11CE-BFC1-08002BE10318}<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Tcpip adapters and interfaces<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\services\\Tcpip\\Parameters\\Adapters\nHKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\services\\Tcpip\\Parameters\\Interfaces<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tIf they are not deleted together, they will remain.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCaution: this deletes registry keys for network adapters.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/windows\/network\/delete_ghost_adapter_names\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/windows\/network\/delete_ghost_adapter_names\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='item_block-disabled sidebar-nav-norm sidebar-nav-l-1' >\r\n\t\t&nbsp;\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/windows\/network\/network_profiles' data-target='computer\/os\/windows\/network\/network_profiles' data-title='Network profiles' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Network profiles<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/os\/windows\/network' data-target='computer\/os\/windows\/network' data-title='Network'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>